      ],
      "walkthrough": [
        "Express the quadratic in the form $(2x + a)^2 + b$:\n$$4x^2 - 12x + 13 = (2x - 3)^2 - (-3)^2 + 13$$\n$$= (2x - 3)^2 - 9 + 13 = (2x - 3)^2 + 4$$\nwhere $a = -3$ and $b = 4$."
      ],
